1644
01:01:19.630 --> 01:01:24.370
And I have, I have a, in my day planner, I have all the things I'm supposed to do.
而且我有，我有，在我的日程本里，我有所有我要做的事情。

1645
01:01:24.710 --> 01:01:28.930
And then at night I'll look at my day planner and I'll write out a little note and put
然后到了晚上，我会看我的日程本，写一张小纸条，然后把它

1646
01:01:28.930 --> 01:01:30.290
it up in the, in the kitchen.
贴在，贴在厨房里。

1647
01:01:30.450 --> 01:01:31.110
Your cheat sheet.
你的小抄。

1648
01:01:31.110 --> 01:01:34.210
The cheat sheet, this is what you're, yeah, that's a short abbreviated version of what
小抄，这就是你，对，那是简略版的关于

1649
01:01:34.210 --> 01:01:37.870
I'm going to do that day so that I can get to the satisfaction of checking off that and
我那天要做的事情，这样我就可以获得划掉它的满足感，然后

1650
01:01:37.870 --> 01:01:39.750
